Z||000027||batboy||12-05-1999||11:08 AM||||OK, OK. I'm totally convinced now. That car in the pic does have a door frame around the side window and it does look like there is a real rear quarter window. Hood is definitely steel. NOT a Fiero! It's beginning to look like maybe a Grand Am to me. I'll leave the pic up for a few more days and then I'm pulling it off my site. Can't believe I got taken in with this hoax.<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 12-05-1999).]||||reg||1
